{% comment %}
  Core entity schema for Lbass Original.
  Keep this factual: no street address, awards, certifications, or review data
  unless verified by the owner.

  ── LOCATION (confirmed by owner 2026-08-03: Marrakech) ──
  addressLocality is set to Marrakech with NO streetAddress. That is the honest
  shape: it states where the business actually is without claiming a walk-in
  storefront at a specific door. Locality alone is a genuine local-relevance
  signal for "friperie marrakech" / "حوايج مستعملة مراكش" style queries.

  ── WHY OnlineStore AND NOT Store ──
  This used to declare @type "Store" with openingHoursSpecification 09:00–22:00
  daily. Both of those assert a physical shop the public can walk into during
  those hours — which has never been verified. Google treats Store/LocalBusiness
  as a bricks-and-mortar claim, and an unverifiable one costs trust rather than
  buying it.

  OnlineStore is the accurate type for a store that sells online and ships
  nationally. No opening or support hours are declared: the owner confirmed
  on 2026-08-20 that customers may send a WhatsApp message at any time, but
  that does not mean a guaranteed 24/7 response window.

  IF a walk-in shop in Marrakech genuinely exists, this should become a second
  LocalBusiness node WITH streetAddress + geo + a Google Business Profile — that
  is a large local-SEO win, but it needs the real address first. Do not add it
  speculatively.

  This snippet is ALSO the fix-injection point for the homepage. templates/index.liquid
  uses {% layout none %}, so layout/theme.liquid never wraps the homepage — but
  index.liquid does render THIS snippet, which makes it the only server-side hook
  available there. The renders at the bottom rely on that.
{% endcomment %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
[
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Organization",
    "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#organization",
    "name": "Lbass Original",
    {%- comment -%}
      Spellings extended 2026-08-23 from 90 days of Search Console. People search
      this brand in Arabic and in Latin transliteration, and the site was ranking
      39-48 for its OWN name — a brand should not be on page 4 for itself:
          البس    10 impr  pos 39.0      labass  2 impr  pos 40.0
          لاباس    4 impr  pos 48.0      labas   2 impr  pos 48.0
          متجر البس 4 impr  pos  6.2
      Every value below is a spelling OBSERVED in GSC for this domain, not an
      invented synonym. Do not pad this list with generic words.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    "alternateName": ["Lbass", "Labas", "Labass", "لباس اوريجينال", "لاباس اوريجينال", "لاباس", "البس", "لباس"],
    "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
    "logo": "https:{{ 'lbass-wordmark-horizontal.svg' | asset_url }}",
    "description": "Lbass Original هو متجر مغربي من مراكش كيعرض حوايج second-hand أصلية، صبابط، إكسسوارات وstreetwear مختارة من ألمانيا، كتتشيك وكتتصور فمراكش، وكتتوصل لكل المغرب.",
    "telephone": "+491754264425",
    "email": "contact@lbassoriginal.com",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Marrakech",
      "addressRegion": "Marrakech-Safi",
      "addressCountry": "MA"
    },
    "contactPoint": [
      {
        "@type": "ContactPoint",
        "telephone": "+491754264425",
        "email": "contact@lbassoriginal.com",
        "url": "{{ shop.url }}/pages/contact",
        "contactType": "customer support",
        "areaServed": "MA",
        "availableLanguage": ["ar-MA", "ar", "fr", "en"]
      }
    ],
    "areaServed": {
      "@type": "Country",
      "name": "Morocco"
    },
    "sameAs": [
      "https://www.instagram.com/lbas.original/",
      "https://www.facebook.com/lbassoriginal"
    ]
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#website",
    "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
    "name": "Lbass Original",
    "inLanguage": "ar-MA",
    "publisher": {
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#organization"
    },
    "potentialAction": {
      "@type": "SearchAction",
      "target": "{{ shop.url }}{{ routes.search_url }}?q={search_term_string}",
      "query-input": "required name=search_term_string"
    }
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "OnlineStore",
    "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#store",
    "name": "Lbass Original",
    "url": {{ shop.url | json }},
    "image": "https:{{ 'hero-lifestyle-1.webp' | asset_url }}",
    "description": "Lbass Original est une friperie en ligne basée à Marrakech, spécialisée dans les vêtements de marque second hand, sneakers, accessoires et streetwear sélectionnés en Allemagne, vérifiés et photographiés à Marrakech. Livraison au Maroc: 20 MAD à Marrakech et 40 MAD ailleurs; COD ou PayPal.",
    "email": "contact@lbassoriginal.com",
    "currenciesAccepted": "MAD",
    "paymentAccepted": ["Cash on delivery", "PayPal"],
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Marrakech",
      "addressRegion": "Marrakech-Safi",
      "addressCountry": "MA"
    },
    "areaServed": {
      "@type": "Country",
      "name": "Morocco"
    },
    "parentOrganization": {
      "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#organization"
    }
  }
]
</script>

